<title>USA: SPR Inc IPO pricing range cut in filing.</title>
<headline>SPR Inc IPO pricing range cut in filing.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price to buy shares in the initial public offering of SPR Inc has been cut to $13 to $15, according to a registration filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on Monday.</p>
<p>The range had previously been estimated at $14 to $16. The number of shares to be offered, 2.7 million, remains the same. Lead underwriter Smith Barney said the offering is tentatively scheduled for early in March.</p>
</text>
